    "task_id": "web_sheet_prozilla_nhis_08",
    "instruction": "Could you open '4대사회보험료 모의계산' in NHIS. Set monthly pay=5000000 and worker count=1,000인 이상 기업, 국가지방자치단체, then calculate. Record the displayed 합계 row values for 총액, 근로자, and 사업주. In Spreadsheet, set A1:B5 with A1='항목', B1='값', A2='총액', A3='근로자', A4='사업주', and A5='차이', then record the displayed values in B2:B4 and set B5 to '=B4-B3'. In Prozilla OS, create ~/Documents/finance_report.txt and write the results in the format 'Total: [value]원', 'Worker: [value]원', 'Employer: [value]원', and 'Gap: [value]원'.",
