    "instruction": "Could you open the Hi-Pass 통행요금 조회 page and scroll to the 차종구분 table. Copy the six class names into a spreadsheet. In the spreadsheet, calculate `Has Light Car` with `=IF(COUNTIF(A2:A7,\"*경형자동차*\")>0,\"YES\",\"NO\")`. Save `~/Documents/hipass_toll_029.txt` using the copied class names and spreadsheet result in the format 'Class Names: [value] | Has Light Car: [value]'.",
