    "task_id": "web_sheet_prozilla_juso_01",
    "instruction": "Could you open Juso address search at https://www.juso.go.kr/. Search for `서울특별시 중구 세종대로 110`. Select the first result whose road address contains `서울특별시` and \"중구\", `세종대로`, and building number `110`. Copy the postal code, road address, and jibun address if shown. Record them in Spreadsheet columns Search Query, Postal Code, Road Address, and Jibun Address. Set `Zip Prefix` to `=LEFT(B2,2)` and `Road Keyword` to `세종대로`, and `Address Check` to `=IF(AND(ISNUMBER(SEARCH(\"서울특별시\",C2)),ISNUMBER(SEARCH(\"세종대로\",C2)),ISNUMBER(SEARCH(\"110\",C2))),\"MATCH\",\"CHECK\")`. Save `~/Documents/juso_address_001.txt` in the format 'Scenario: 서울시청 address lookup | Search Query: 서울특별시 중구 세종대로 110 | Postal Code: [value] | Road Address: [value] | Jibun Address: [value] | Zip Prefix: [value] | Road Keyword: 세종대로 | Address Check: [value]'.",
    "website": {
      "web": "https://www.juso.go.kr/",
      "sheet": "local spreadsheet application",
      "os": "~/Documents/juso_address_001.txt"
    },
    "evaluation": {
      "mode": "all",
      "operator": "and",
      "rules": [
        {
          "target": "os_file",
          "path": "~/Documents/juso_address_001.txt",
          "text": "Scenario: 서울시청 address lookup",
          "match": "contains"
        },
